From 183d7802a0f3f8060752fe60fcb794376c423d39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:35:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix mobile bugs: multitouch, save, creative items, inventory
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bug #1 (kontrol ngawur): Added _multitouch_feed export in
wasm/main_emscripten.cpp that calls Multitouch::feed with per-finger
pointerId (0..11, Multitouch.h:12 MAX_POINTERS). JS shim forwards each
browser touch with its own pointerId so D-pad + look work simultaneously.

Bug #2 (inventori bodoh): JS shim taps hotbar '...' slot to open
creative inventory (Gui::handleClick at Gui.cpp:187-189).

Bug #4 (item tidak lengkap): Added wasm/creative_items.cpp with
_inject_creative_items export that injects missing tools (pickaxe/
shovel/axe all tiers), weapons (sword all tiers), arrows, food
(apple, mushroom stew), materials (stick, coal, ingots, emerald),
utility (flintAndSteel, hoe all tiers) into player creative inventory
via addItem (accessed via #define protected public, Rule Zero compliant
browser adaptation — rujukan/ immutable).

Bug #6 (tidak bisa save): Implemented saveFile/loadFile in
wasm/AppPlatform_emscripten.cpp using Emscripten MEMFS (FS.writeFile/
FS.readFile + FS.mkdirTree). Removed -DNO_STORAGE from build.sh so
game uses ExternalFileLevelStorageSource. JS shim syncs /data to
localStorage for persistence across page reloads.

Build: Recompiled with emsdk 2.0.34 (version that produces correct
rendering codegen). gles.cpp compiled with -DanGenBuffers=
anGenBuffers_gles_impl to avoid duplicate symbol with anGenBuffers
override in platform_stubs.cpp (which calls real glGenBuffers for
VBO rendering).

Added wasm/select_item.cpp with _select_item_by_id export for
testing item selection by ID.

Rule Zero: rujukan/ source tree is 1:1 with SSMG64/PocketEdition
(1063 cpp/h files, verified identical). All changes are in wasm/
(browser adaptation layer) or minecraft-wasm.html (JS shim).
